main.go:1376-1390: a config flag written with an equals sign, or a boolean flag, makes extractSubcommand return empty, so the launcher starts the full stack -- editor and agent -- instead of running the one-shot setup the user asked for. An unknown sub-command also falls through to launching rather than erroring. Acceptance: recognise a fixed set of sub-command words positionally and reject unknown positionals.
